From e8a20a066c0f016cfff0f5d917a4abaaa4eac124 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: D313373 <d.1337.edu@gmail.com>
Date: Tue, 1 Sep 2026 18:51:42 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add script export with PII/credential scan before sharing.

Export scans type actions for email, phone, SSN, API keys, and password-field literals, requiring either secret tokens or an explicit acknowledgment before downloading a shareable script package.

Co-authored-by: Cursor <cursoragent@cursor.com>
---
